{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b0a190873c41803457597aff715622f747b909560b29877a7815b968fed4cfbb", "ja": "公演メンバーにプチ不幸が続く。自分のせい\nではと落ち込む歩だが、ダンスイベントに\n出演する事に。会場へ向かう飛行機が欠航し\n不安な中、歩は自分の不幸はプチで、ダンス\nができなかった事はないと皆を励ます。", "zh": "公演成员身上接连发生小不幸。步消沉地以为\n是自己的错，但还是决定参加舞蹈活动。\n前往会场的航班停飞，在不安的气氛中，步鼓励\n大家说自己的不幸都是小事，从未因此跳不成舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7c9cc1e823729ae4e607b5790bd34302e93fa15e618aa4296ed8ac7e7ba4d431", "ja": "いたた……しまった、腰を痛めてしまったかな……。\nまさか倉庫のダンボールが、あんなに重いとは……。", "zh": "好痛……糟糕，好像把腰给闪了……\n没想到仓库里的纸箱居然那么重……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cdd51b72dbf6d75cea1fafeab412c1fbd9f7831578b9c19872c4e9ee71b3e039", "ja": "今日のレッスンは……もう終わった頃だな。\n声だけでも掛けていくか……。", "zh": "今天的训练……应该已经结束了。\n至少去打个招呼吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1002_se", "source_sha256": "c18f010bc2dab1a06a318731381656a22c97c9cca9b1c0c05979bec047eca6f3", "ja": "バチンッ", "zh": "啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "aab88fc4dcb59fcee217210a58f82097c2056dd9d88dc190bb09cc207263cc71", "ja": "うおっ、弦が切れた！？\n張り替えたばっかなのに、ついてないな……。", "zh": "哇，弦断了！？\n明明才刚换不久，真倒霉啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "51b94253f4bd386b95728d1008f10feb857f785051785bd4d31eb98bbe3639e7", "ja": "ついてない……あっ！　私もありました！", "zh": "真倒霉……啊！我也遇到过这种事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "e9c5fb490d42557364b286249c0539e45b083651e8a4b26ce9d7ed001d36ae14", "ja": "最近、スーパーで買い物をすると、\n毎回1円足りないんですよねー。絶対、1円なんです！", "zh": "最近啊，我去超市买东西，\n每次都差1日元。一定是1日元！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "be37adbbce34a549fe778bdf6fc391aae4a876a229a8ea81b8f08c942db52294", "ja": "うわー、なんか微妙だねそれ。てか、\nついてないといえば、アタシもなんだけど……。", "zh": "哇——这也太微妙了吧。话说回来，要说不走运，我也一样啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "7df1746f88d75e620ec8c3b527462fdfca074972ecd90e6838765b01c9de94f6", "ja": "欲しい限定リップが、どこ行っても売り切れでさ～。\nぜんぜん見つかんないの！", "zh": "我想要的限定款唇膏，不管去哪儿都卖光了～。\n完全找不到嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "d0b92cc4bb64bee22dc501c443c12941779e2f9cf92bec568ffb27da3753cf2d", "ja": "私も最近、毎日寝坊してばっかりなんですよね～。\nちゃんと同じ時間に寝てるのに、なんでだろ？", "zh": "我最近也总是每天睡过头呢～。\n明明每天都在同一时间睡觉，真奇怪，到底是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5c62fa98e6c334cb923a55393615499d2c4edd3f2c1686bdccf91d8925ceb2dd", "ja": "……ジュリアは弦が切れて、やよいは1円足りなくて。\n恵美はリップが売り切れで、未来は寝坊して……。", "zh": "……茱莉亚断了琴弦，弥生差了1日元。\n惠美的润唇膏卖光了，未来又睡过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4f41e637e905b472ad250db1243d12768f381c9037354ac13f4f47f5c1e3575d", "ja": "やっぱり、アタシのプチ不幸がみんなにも……！？", "zh": "果然，连大家都受到了我的小不幸影响……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "afb431ffdc18c2efc244e4acc88defd6ebfa0b74a8401253a65d4bd2cdd6228d", "ja": "そ、そんなの絶対関係ないです！\n歩さんのせいじゃないですよ！", "zh": "不、不是的！这绝对没有关系！\n这不是步小姐的错哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd5c3b27a4a22f2ec8ac96064906189b130ccd8c85d69c3193759fcccaf7332b", "ja": "そうそう、考えすぎだって。それに、\n未来のはただの寝坊で、不幸とは違うだろ？", "zh": "对对，你想太多了。而且，\n未来那次只是睡过头，和不幸可不一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "9ea4416552989f2141fa767c8f69a1d350edc6befcdbf41b4df7cd3060741a67", "ja": "そうでした……でへへ♪", "zh": "对哦……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1014_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "afe6d9068bbd889bbe61f838110154da56d35d818dc8af10ac2b6292cd8342cb", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんが来た！\n遅いですよ～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生来了！\n真慢啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "949b1cc358637f1ef0b772ff860b2a450ed7231a1cfff3e0484fa45c9f515084", "ja": "{$P$}、さっそくですけど、\n歩さんを励ましてあげてください！！", "zh": "{$P$}，虽然一上来就拜托您，但请赶紧去鼓励一下步姐姐！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7554353416b24f58fdfe6d491a684b827115c1e1eb75c1bd4156b2c840365a81", "ja": "み、みんな、遅れてすまん……。\n……あたたたた……！", "zh": "大、大家，抱歉来晚了……  \n……疼疼疼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9eeacdb1b8d2228e3f40aff328b03aefdaf6342c71ff2591bb5a5fbba43d8ac5", "ja": "ちょっと腰を痛めちゃったみたいで……。\nところで、励ますって何の話だ？", "zh": "好像不小心把腰弄伤了……。\n话说回来，你们说的鼓励是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f92f40f89b4c4c7bb0344f250a6e1f2d36b61160da11d767da56563fc5bef168", "ja": "{$P$}まで……！？", "zh": "连{$P$}也……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "8e59c9615cf7e22ae1e9ed6f796209092077ec2737685450ccc4df8b75bbca29", "ja": "タイミング悪いな～……。", "zh": "真不巧啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "54dbd636811e407528372d967b38282587764ca1c84cce8d6186d77a4fca5dfe", "ja": "にゃはは……。", "zh": "呀哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6fdb9ceabf70f89aa94ff7964cc6b8cd0a917e7a2fdda7d54db488929ac0f691", "ja": "なるほど……つまり最近みんながついてないのは、\n歩のプチ不幸のせいだと。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，最近大家总是走霉运，\n都是因为步的小小不幸咯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1ce731b97060f0bc79de37324d38996271aa4390fc719a9d0e88b6771adcb4d0", "ja": "だって……あんまりにも、タイミングが\n良すぎる……いや、悪すぎる……？", "zh": "因为……这时机也实在是，太巧了……不，太不巧了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "69ff1f6df44d986be8400bee3b795db1d62ce12e9394f3089db7acfa73f3fca4", "ja": "とにかく、偶然にしては\nできすぎてる、っていうか！", "zh": "总之，这也太巧了吧，简直不像是偶然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1025_p", "source_sha256": "9efaf35146a6569563f9fa1318cef1de4eafc4303add1d5831cb8c4d1e53829f", "ja": "言っておくけど、俺の腰痛は荷物を持ち上げたせいで、\n歩のせいじゃないから……あたたたた！", "zh": "我先说清楚，我腰疼是因为搬东西搬的，不是歩的原因……哎哟哟哟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "e0bfb462b2d1503a0a3d3aee714d7505090b15ed3b3798c51eeb972e92254b54", "ja": "あー、もう{$P$}！\nとりあえずほら、湿布貼ってあげるから！", "zh": "啊——真是的，{$P$}！\n总之，来，我帮你贴上膏药！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1027_p", "source_sha256": "87b42956f1405110d636ca6b8968490c51636612a616f57f5eda2a5a71a25f6b", "ja": "ありがとう、恵美……。とにかく、関係ないし。\n気にする必要なんかないからな。", "zh": "谢谢你，惠美……总之，这和你没关系。\n你没必要在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1028_005yay", "source_sha256": "80e84b82e4a60446c783225bd6a59fe96fea69de2e4f5e0f057cd29167a20786", "ja": "そうですよ！　それに歩さん、昨日、\n私のこと助けてくれたじゃないですか！", "zh": "就是啊！而且步姐姐昨天还帮过我，不是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "15de3c9f237a0804fbe9c747d936de93002cfd3ea04edc647170c832aee8a89f", "ja": "助けた？　……アタシ、なんかしたっけ？", "zh": "我帮过你？……我做过什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "02b7b852675111c5fd9da3ccf55f4afaf8a864ce34af82adbee122d4a0e944d8", "ja": "はい！　私、買い物のメモを劇場の\nどこかに落としちゃって、探してたんです。", "zh": "是的！我把购物清单掉在剧场的某个地方了，一直在找呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1031_005yay", "source_sha256": "8ef51bf23b95537ef94f76cceaab291b6f28decffbf489de09d52892d247c8db", "ja": "そしたら歩さんが、『メモってこれ？』って。\nレッスンルームに落ちてたって、届けてくれたんです！", "zh": "然后步小姐问：“是这张便签吗？”说是在练习室捡到的，就给我送过来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "3fd7f6be6f6e20ee21fae4428ead2c4d4b67bee01b4c15668b8df9693f75b654", "ja": "ええっ、すごーい！？\n歩さん、よくわかりましたね？", "zh": "诶诶，好厉害！？\n步小姐，你居然认出来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "877acf2640040d852a68ca9796c6bd5a422a03f3571bc5786691a1c63d6f244b", "ja": "あ、うん。なんか野菜の名前とかいっぱい\n書いてあったから、やよいかなって……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。因为上面写了好多蔬菜的名字之类的，我就猜是弥生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "a9cc4b5230b59947b3b40573b68bfa44782cf1f16d8de77d67e386db0e4cadb1", "ja": "そういえば……ここに、予備の弦があるんだけど。\nこれってこの前、歩が買ってきてくれたやつだよな。", "zh": "说起来……这里有备用的琴弦。这就是前些天步帮我买回来的那些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "968ffed8635ea42bd86541b59dc312ebb1cea2ef2a9d7be0fbb7e352f2f82480", "ja": "『いま楽器屋の近くなんだけど、弦が欲しいとか\n言ってなかったっけ？』って連絡くれてさ。", "zh": "“我现在在乐器店附近，你之前是不是说过\n想要琴弦来着？”——还特地联系了我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "40c1eb091a95ad60a6567d6d3de0570fd407b461b5f967cefbf90c96561e3cd4", "ja": "それは、服買いに行ったショッピングモールに、\nたまたま楽器屋があっただけだって！", "zh": "只是我去买衣服的购物中心里，碰巧有家乐器店而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "e4aea2fa4c91e46ec9a7c8551c0943e0631d0202a2f999465cd919bbe2e994d1", "ja": "でも……私だったら、楽器屋さんがあるのに\n気がつかないか、すぐには思い出せないかも？", "zh": "不过……如果是我的话，可能根本没注意到那里有乐器店，或者一时半会儿也想不起来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "6bd02cbd34c748339f49e5b2f563cfeb26b5a391bd2d955db2e5c146695f8833", "ja": "ほら！　歩が気が付いてくれたおかげで、\nふたりとも超助かってるじゃん。", "zh": "看吧！多亏步注意到了，我们俩都得救了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1039_p", "source_sha256": "87e0a5a689ec32f1d26f9ebf7b3a5e33c57d466d86e9eb19f594826cd5fe4a50", "ja": "なんだ。歩のせいで不幸になるんじゃなくて、\n歩がみんなの不幸を助けてるんじゃないか。", "zh": "原来不是因为步而变得不幸，而是步在帮助大家摆脱不幸啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1040_p", "source_sha256": "aa4c3c64c58659b81f94103ca76ac04a2a3d07f26087b93a3ab67d944be32ad3", "ja": "だったらなおさら、気にする必要なんかないな！", "zh": "既然这样，就更没什么好在意的了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e08618eb7a9131f8ac8c0d127388ac488761cfed9004f7726e7f4c72d6c55050", "ja": "みんな、{$P$}……ありがと。\nそうだね、気にしすぎもよくないだろうし……。", "zh": "大家，{$P$}……谢谢。\n是啊，太在意也不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1042_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e572e59f82bf66f9c897e0389a3027681eb925ce278449baf3aa715b1740fa2d", "ja": "よし！　イベントに向けて、気持ち切り替えてこう！\nアタシ、もうちょっとレッスンしてこっかな！", "zh": "好！为了活动，转换一下心情，打起精神来吧！\n我再去练习一会儿好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "864733cb7b6efda77844b716bb088a9d359146a293037cf40addc37244b8fa19", "ja": "あっ、なら私も参加しまーす♪\n難しかったとこ、もう1回練習しておきたいです！", "zh": "啊，那我也参加——♪\n想再把难的地方练习1遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "17b847c696ef3e631fa39ece352547ef48635114093e49d709995124de9760d9", "ja": "あたしもまだ自信ないんだよな……。\n歩、一緒にいいか？", "zh": "我也还没什么自信呢……\n步，要一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1350e3ad0ef41467125de70dec86bafc093da872d80eb2d93143f7cdc1f8c760", "ja": "オッケー！\nそれじゃ、みんなで一緒にやろう！", "zh": "好！\n那我们大家一起做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1046_005yay", "source_sha256": "2122b2a9b34c1febd08e4ddc8bf2e18f3f8c4a91c344b3882ae2d4e624d7a976", "ja": "はい！　もっともーっと練習して、\n本番までに上手になっちゃいましょう！", "zh": "好的！再多加练习，\n争取在正式演出前变得更厉害吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1047_020meg", "source_sha256": "767f823e8b6a102f014d8fcc0419db8fadc6d38ecf597f3fdcaf2d75e74e6c87", "ja": "こうやって全員がそろうのも、残り少ないしね。\n今日のうちに、できるトコまでやっちゃお！", "zh": "像这样全员到齐的机会也不多了。\n今天就尽可能多练一点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1048_null", "source_sha256": "3c2576d839252ed6ed0b1dac3c7cd6eaae3954081e89bb7cfcb5913da998a6bf", "ja": "そして、イベント前日……", "zh": "然后，活动前一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1049_014mir", "source_sha256": "dcc4364bf662b7fb481c9f9931d960ce1be774b9e7b3e217caa5e5ad3dca1611", "ja": "ええっ！？\n飛行機が欠航って……どうしてですか？", "zh": "咦！？\n航班取消了……这是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1050_p", "source_sha256": "7213d49de086982fb4357494c347921845c415ed44d66ae3cf16221200dfd122", "ja": "現地の天候不良が原因だそうだ……。\n雨と風がだいぶ酷いらしくて、欠航が続いてる。", "zh": "听说是因为当地天气恶劣……。\n雨和风似乎都很大，航班一直在停飞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1051_p", "source_sha256": "1de8f8d3f3c041b92263d71c8de8193f14dae7581fd32c35041493c9f38e94d1", "ja": "このままだと、飛ぶかどうかもわからないらしい。\n沖縄だから、他の交通手段も難しいしな……。", "zh": "照这样下去，听说连能不能起飞都不知道。\n毕竟是在冲绳，其他交通方式也很困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1052_020meg", "source_sha256": "acddde01f0097827725de9964f521f3df48b898510a8ae94b80b0c9507094b9b", "ja": "そんな……じゃあアタシたち、\nイベントに出られないってこと？", "zh": "怎么会……那我们岂不是没法参加活动了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1053_p", "source_sha256": "8211a13a2b9cd40ce5547e2bad45cb2df6a880d26cdc6b1407e9099dc2d1e922", "ja": "まだそうと決まったわけじゃない。幸い、\n遅い時間の飛行機に振り替えられたし……。", "zh": "还没完全定下来。万幸的是，\n已经改签到了更晚的航班……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1054_p", "source_sha256": "6ca1e956af4a158b25018a4321464659b2e5aad9ee534700ddfb7fe3a163787b", "ja": "天候が回復すれば、今晩、\n飛行機が飛んでくれる可能性はある。", "zh": "只要天气能好转，今晚\n飞机还是有可能起飞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1055_p", "source_sha256": "eed9ed91c25901d8ee2aa27d7329fb3d2a8cb05e469f3eb8a6e3ef4e3d35cfde", "ja": "今はとにかく、待つしかない状況だ。", "zh": "现在总之只能等着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1056_005yay", "source_sha256": "60199b821edf11f7dbfbc93c0365a5d121f67ff911ea86b16da90c0b4c59f65d", "ja": "そうなんですね……。\nお天気、よくなるといいんですけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样……  \n希望天气能好起来就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1057_050jul", "source_sha256": "7181616419e9f0a233779a4186b1e5835584e9ff8550a59d8408444ed3a87ccc", "ja": "こればっかりは、どうにもできないからな。\nまさか、こんなことになるとは……。", "zh": "这实在是无能为力啊。\n没想到竟然会变成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1058_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1355e84530d1487dad2da4f9efa509117446c1fcf9642461aba191b2cc70d106", "ja": "いや……絶対、大丈夫だよ！", "zh": "不会……绝对没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1059_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5db6348aeda405f56702eb0eaf1d16bc7b1875f74230af42a13da96bc2c38e14", "ja": "{$P$}！\nみんなも、心配することないって！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n大家也完全不用担心啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1060_p", "source_sha256": "2438b313cef7f44261bfacc3c127ac6b180a05819cf10953f2cd45703ccae772", "ja": "歩？", "zh": "步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1061_034ayu", "source_sha256": "96051527debe94b4a8bfbf2f28c5f60e9ba381ed6fc20e2bc169608b76738bc5", "ja": "だって、これでステージに立てなかったら、\nプチ不幸なんてもんじゃない。不幸中の、大不幸だよ！", "zh": "因为，要是这样还没法登上舞台，\n那可就不只是小小的不幸了。简直是不幸中的大不幸啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1062_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c8a0d58e37743b062266b427fb3582198a29f021c9aea8440811f80a0ab54d00", "ja": "アタシ、プチ不幸な目にはよく遭うけどさ。でもそれで\nダンスができなかったことって、一度もないんだよね。", "zh": "我虽然经常遇到些小小的不幸，但也从来没有因此跳不了舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1063_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b993039e008895c4ebd110ce8d362ba95f0ae12f276a80df5f771de1fa8a5c38", "ja": "だからアタシたちは絶対、ステージに立てる！\nそう信じよう！", "zh": "所以我们绝对能站上舞台！\n要相信这一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1064_005yay", "source_sha256": "699aa54f7f51b1312300cd035091b91d6134d737ba0cb337b7056af920f935d2", "ja": "歩さん……。", "zh": "步姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1065_020meg", "source_sha256": "6d24901e199c317b6789a1dd60f05ecb694d482b6b58e9884f9d2c17fad2c7ef", "ja": "ま、それもそっか。\nジタバタしてもしょうがないしね！", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n再怎么折腾也没用嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1066_050jul", "source_sha256": "4d9350487a352e30f0d629010a870e457ace9640ad7917c9b9e9864fe7eab828", "ja": "だな。ま、空港は時間を潰す場所だけは\n目いっぱいあるし。時間まで待つか！", "zh": "是啊。机场里能消磨时间的地方多得很。就在那儿等到时间吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1067_014mir", "source_sha256": "6f2da9f787d1d50151923cae952d82cef8832613578cd5e9bd7f94116f0d7b9f", "ja": "私、お腹空いてきちゃいました！", "zh": "我肚子饿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1068_p", "source_sha256": "154d252c69dbc78dc7dc96cfc2a57c875d1b30887fddea1253026c77da2b036e", "ja": "そうだな。みんなも、信じて待とう！\nひとまず、状況が変わるまで待機するとして……。", "zh": "是啊。大家也一起相信着等下去吧！  \n暂且先等到情况发生变化……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1069_p", "source_sha256": "0ac83fdde320d615f28da181c79ba943b656cd7ef0cf67e8c35ac1782263a425", "ja": "もう昼過ぎだし、何か食べに行こうか。\nみんな、何が食べたい？", "zh": "都过了中午了，去吃点什么吧。\n大家想吃什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1070_p", "source_sha256": "b1e418e34bb744a4016e41e7fd1b7bccf7a00973e979b90a470cad3a9f9efd26", "ja": "（あれから数時間……もう夕方だ。\n現地の天候は、まだ回復していないらしい……）", "zh": "（几小时后……已经傍晚了。听说当地的天气还没有好转……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1071_p", "source_sha256": "2abc7370b0e1408a3da6042cba0fe0ae0e47d0dc65040dcd30aee63bd3d98af0", "ja": "あれ？　歩がいないな……。\nどこに行ったんだろう？", "zh": "咦？步不在啊……\n她去哪里了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1072_p", "source_sha256": "745e73b0de4d8a82d416e4b5a3ebbd886ed79bf275c8170e1865c91e7cf8b350", "ja": "……ちょっと探してみるか。", "zh": "……去找找看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1073_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8670789efddc6c0b25d458d2082badb6922a520fd8036ebb8e714afc78a36bf8", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！\nファイブ、シックス、セブン、エイト！", "zh": "一、二、三、四！\n五、六、七、八！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1074_p", "source_sha256": "817dadde54ac2b20d14246c4f5679236ca974c083b4c80032ba12509148b08cd", "ja": "歩……！\nよかった、ここにいたのか。", "zh": "步……！\n太好了，原来你在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1075_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e674711a8a5d1b2e39f34fd1a67a11f74aeba6f421b4eaf8e6f2db93deec3c90", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nごめん、もしかして探してた？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n抱歉，你该不会是在找我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1076_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e24128fc8b817f110ad2eda575ece1b471df351cdaea48e194ae32e5d9a0e231", "ja": "急に思いついたことがあってさ。\n詰めのとこ、もう一回練習してたんだ。", "zh": "我突然想到了一点东西。\n所以就把最后收尾的部分，又练习了一遍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1077_p", "source_sha256": "d309fbb4acff324f9143d26069b7d1c2a3b6468394a2244d4e55d35ae35c3707", "ja": "そうか……姿が見えなかったから心配したよ。\nでも、踊ってるとは思わなかったけど。", "zh": "这样啊……一直没看到你的身影，我还担心来着。\n不过，没想到你居然在跳舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1078_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0092efb511c18bd6649f5e73307cd6db85619d0e1ca5d9dd12831b47274bc3f1", "ja": "アハハ……なんか、じっとしてられなくてさ。\n踊り始めたら、止まらなくなっちゃって。", "zh": "啊哈哈……总觉得就是没法安静待着。\n一跳起来，就停不下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1079_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6ac3354f8206004328c58982624d45e80fdef2750992212c07d33b8af0249d05", "ja": "……こんな状況で踊ってるのって、変かな？", "zh": "……在这种情况下跳舞，很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1080_p", "source_sha256": "2d41f4f55eefea12da90b0da9ca708f8f23a84bc549bb78e933ce1be4088edca", "ja": "いや、歩が落ち着くならいいんだ。\nここは人も少ないしな。", "zh": "不，只要步能平静下来就好。\n而且这里人也很少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1081_034ayu", "source_sha256": "39401eab3ff59c1fd77859fa11f432bcc4dd5604fc8425a2a049509a35fffdaf", "ja": "落ち着く……そうなんだよね。つらくても\n寂しくても、そういう時こそダンスしちゃうな……。", "zh": "让人平静……确实是这样。就算再难受、\n再孤独，越是那种时候就越想跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1082_p", "source_sha256": "3daa697d7729e6ada512c193d5c232739b41e7c7b396175d1045d185f96ee60a", "ja": "留学してた時も、そうだったのか？", "zh": "留学的时候也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1083_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dcd3cf01495cb4a78e6d55700e0f757fe51ee022594c391995e18952599020d9", "ja": "うん。踊ってる時は、ダンスのことだけ考えてれば\nいいから。他のこと気にしなくて済むし……。", "zh": "嗯。跳舞的时候，只要考虑舞蹈的事\n就可以了。而且也不用去在意别的事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1084_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bf4da34c39376777b1db7292ffae3c955f3e9c317e1df1971dcc662b154a3030", "ja": "……あれ？　こういうのも、現実逃避って言うのかな？\nもしかしてアタシ、けっこう情けない？", "zh": "……咦？这种情况，也能叫逃避现实吗？\n难道说我……其实还挺没出息的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1085_p", "source_sha256": "e29f39e4ebfac8d0584428db010320185aab52f257f250b08ec91288bc155710", "ja": "いや、逃避とは言い切れないんじゃないかな。\nだって歩は、現実を変えるために踊ってるんだから。", "zh": "不，我觉得不能断言那是逃避。\n因为步是为了改变现实才跳舞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1086_p", "source_sha256": "5b9c792090cf49a54e7bf13e0d2fead93689afa9b48d4f85fc954f41be1f8ec9", "ja": "それに自分の弱さを知っているからこそ、\n人の痛みがわかるし、優しくできるんだと思う。", "zh": "而且，正因为步了解自己的软弱，我觉得她才能理解他人的痛苦，也才能对人温柔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1087_p", "source_sha256": "795116c636f446546e9fa6dadb47d7b658452dac1e7f6f2a1f084a9dd053d6c5", "ja": "そんな優しい歩が、ダンスを踊ると最強の\nダンスヒーローになる。すごくかっこいいと思うよ！", "zh": "这么温柔的步，一跳起舞来就会变成最强的舞蹈英雄。我觉得超帅的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1089_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a81d7d41fdb0cc9c8df4798f218bead267b7918ba1189a8226f1b7ca0fd450b", "ja": "へへっ、サンキュー！　そんなふうに言ってくれるの、\n{$P$}だけだよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢！会这么说的，只有{$P$}哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1090_p", "source_sha256": "7cfaaa1690f849a9cdfa079b025e43c37afe32a43481efc926c919013b20ee28", "ja": "そんな事ないさ。\n他のみんなも、きっとそう思ってるはずだ。", "zh": "没那回事。\n其他人也一定都是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1091_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a8c1b29abeee6fb8457c2937797545c874515749ce4fe9350bacbc8d67289121", "ja": "そうかな？　だったらうれしいけど。\nでも、そうだね……。", "zh": "是这样吗？如果真是那样，我会很开心的。\n不过，确实呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1092_034ayu", "source_sha256": "505668a50b68fe415e6b57e630fb04df13f5ed2d4a55f80f5cd46e39b62c5580", "ja": "ダンスを踊ってる時だけは、普段のアタシより\n強くなれるっていうか……強くなりたい！って思う！", "zh": "跳舞的时候，我感觉自己能变得比平时更强……或者说……我想变得更强！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1093_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7420185c367abbb9ac5db4fa84c3433a04279d4a20dd4221adb3f4a428ee21c3", "ja": "今なら、なんでもできるって気がしてくるんだ。\n未来だって、変えられるんじゃないかってくらい。", "zh": "现在的话，总觉得自己什么都能做到。\n甚至觉得，或许连未来都能改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1094_p", "source_sha256": "3f01845b0d1d5a44f81c73ff79436ffaae0cb736c7360c81d5df69476eac9e5a", "ja": "うん。俺も歩のダンスを見てると、こんな状況でも、\nどうにかなるんじゃないかって思えるよ。", "zh": "嗯。我看着步的舞蹈，就算是在这种情况下，也会觉得一定能想办法解决的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1095_034ayu", "source_sha256": "55b8766e83f174e57cce2cd070cc2f00cde2c2815e04913858e51cffd21bd130", "ja": "ホント？", "zh": "真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1096_p", "source_sha256": "679b290c9dacd99d48e8a05d728e396709495e8ca91daeff212ed9c281a97f0f", "ja": "本当だ。そうやって、つらい夜を\n乗り越えてきたんだな、歩は。ダンスと一緒に。", "zh": "是真的。步就是这样，和舞蹈一起熬过了那些难熬的夜晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1097_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c4dc382c17befb7af8debd663648a76ae30af92d52708ef236400392b35989ec", "ja": "……うん。そうかも。", "zh": "……嗯。也许吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1098_034ayu", "source_sha256": "62e9af40065ee9ea00bbc22505dda800610a4b3195437f6af304df8a36337de5", "ja": "あっ……ねえ、{$P$}も踊らない？\nアタシが教えてあげるよ！　ほら！", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}也来跳舞吗？\n我来教你哦！来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1099_p", "source_sha256": "a39c10624424f061bfae0d3915238aff87857744a7ba52fa1fa7930f13f61b47", "ja": "あっ、歩！？\nまだ腰が……！", "zh": "啊，步！？\n我的腰还……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1100_p", "source_sha256": "7782b1d31632c45e36047abb578526dfe40f4667a5b3dc37e664bcc2ef58b603", "ja": "……って、あれ？　痛くない？\n手を引っ張られた衝撃で、治った……のか……？", "zh": "……咦，奇怪？不疼了？\n被拉住手的冲击治好了……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1101_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9bf3b406295e4021726f40279a9b64c8dd43c3591668645efba2d6c914696a98", "ja": "ええっ！？\nそんなことある？", "zh": "诶诶！？\n还能有这种事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1102_p", "source_sha256": "ca1375571f4b9d178b21150f386bb3567f4801659166d7fd8856825ffa0b5a14", "ja": "いや、本当に……不思議なくらい痛くないんだ。", "zh": "不，真的……简直不可思议，居然一点都不疼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1103_p", "source_sha256": "586e547d70143c4605a0b91266715791198eae23faaa73452b732def66359436", "ja": "これも、『歩のお陰で助かった』うちの\nひとつになるんじゃないか？", "zh": "这也算是“多亏了步才得救”的事情之一吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1104_034ayu", "source_sha256": "67db3d4ec0d9021d6ac9986f87b7c950fefabe6a87474da167209215820efeff", "ja": "ホントだ……！　あははっ！\nやったね、{$P$}！", "zh": "真的……！啊哈哈！成功啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1105_020meg", "source_sha256": "cd716b6ee0ddbec108c5e48d57165a3eb4e27d40f6f1ba6a488522be9da3520f", "ja": "おーい、歩ー！\n{$P$}！", "zh": "喂——，步——！\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_158_1106_014mir", "source_sha256": "e50a4d67758789d8abacbed0f6a81b50c24159ea69b4c5a719e9aa2e6d4c4374", "ja": "お天気、回復したみたいです！\nじゅんじ、うんこうをさいかい！するそうですよー！", "zh": "天气好像已经恢复了！\n听说会依次恢复运行哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
